"""Opening braces versus continuations after closing delimiters.

'from' is negative, especially after an import list. Else/catch after closed
blocks and formula continuations after closed groups are also negative.
Opening braces are usually positive. Tuples give responses in ordinary context,
after a closing brace, after a square bracket, and after a parenthesis.
Only one previous token is remembered, within the current document.
