    same_doc = (len(prefix.token_ids) > 1 and
                prefix.document_ids[-1] == prefix.document_ids[-2])
    previous = prefix.token_strings[-2] if same_doc else ''
    return None, float(predict_token(prefix.token_strings[-1], previous))

"""A detector for written backslash escapes, especially '\\n'.

It distinguishes whole-token escapes from escapes split across tokens, and
newline letters fused with following text. Repeated backslashes weaken
the split newline signal. There are smaller responses to TeX commands,
escaped punctuation, and four split Russian 'не-' word beginnings.
This is a local text-pattern approximation, not a general parser.
