"""A mostly local signal for the opening of arguments and string literals.

Look at delimiters merged into the current token, not balanced parentheses in
whole text. Quoted arguments are strongest; printing/logging names weaken
that response. Identifiers, types and unary symbols give smaller responses.
Whitespace-prefixed bare parentheses and empty calls are weak. End-of-text
separators are positive. Small word-specific fluctuations are left at zero.
